This package is an unofficial fork of Cinegy.TsDecoder. Changes by Kreisverkehr
include support for current-multiplex EIT schedule tables, scheduled-table
change notifications, transport-stream timestamp and duration conversions,
tests for EIT schedule decoding, EIT parsing fixes for pointer fields, section
assembly, and descriptor loop boundaries, and PAT section assembly across
multiple transport packets.

